        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
        <a href="#chat" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="home" class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <section class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">📚 Neo helps learners at every level</div>
        <h1>Study smarter with an AI assistant built for school, college, and university.</h1>
        <p>
          Neo explains topics simply, helps with homework, supports exam prep, and adjusts its answers to the learner’s level.
          Whether you are in primary school, high school, university, or learning as an adult, Neo is built to help.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#chat" class="btn btn-primary">Start Learning</a>
          <a href="#levels" class="btn btn-secondary">Choose Your Level</a>
        </div>

        <div class="trust-row">
          <div class="trust-pill">Simple explanations</div>
          <div class="trust-pill">All subjects</div>
          <div class="trust-pill">Level-based answers</div>
          <div class="trust-pill">Exam support</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="hero-panel">
        <div class="panel-top">
          <div>
            <div class="selector-title">Learning mode</div>
