  <section id="faq" class="section">
    <div class="container section-card">
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">A few common things people may want to know about Neo.</p>

      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How does Neo help learners?</h3>
          <p>Neo explains topics, gives examples, helps with homework, and supports revision at different levels.</p>
        </div>
